1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,385
The Bus Going the Other Way.

3
00:00:03,385 --> 00:00:05,969
Dad and I are taking the bus to the museum.

4
00:00:05,969 --> 00:00:09,042
We find a stop with the right number and wait under the sign.

5
00:00:09,042 --> 00:00:11,625
I feel very proud of my excellent planning.

6
00:00:11,908 --> 00:00:14,275
Did you check which direction it's going?

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,744
Same number, same bus.

8
00:00:16,744 --> 00:00:18,212
Isn't that enough?

9
00:00:18,212 --> 00:00:20,223
Dad points across the street.

10
00:00:20,223 --> 00:00:22,473
There's another stop with the same number.

11
00:00:22,473 --> 00:00:25,067
Before I can answer, a bus pulls up.

12
00:00:25,348 --> 00:00:26,467
Morning.

13
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:27,842
Where are you headed?

14
00:00:28,132 --> 00:00:30,134
Does this bus go to the museum?

15
00:00:30,364 --> 00:00:33,816
It does on the way back, but you're on the wrong side of the street.

16
00:00:33,816 --> 00:00:36,129
You want the stop across from this one.

17
00:00:36,412 --> 00:00:37,937
Thanks for checking.

18
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:39,791
We'll cross at the lights.

19
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:43,127
We wait for the crossing signal and walk to the other stop.

20
00:00:43,127 --> 00:00:46,325
The little route map shows the museum four stops away.

21
00:00:46,325 --> 00:00:48,939
My excellent planning needs a small update.

22
00:00:49,228 --> 00:00:51,657
Good thing we asked before we sat down.

23
00:00:51,892 --> 00:00:55,052
When the next bus arrives, I ask the driver again.

24
00:00:55,052 --> 00:00:57,354
This time, she says yes.

25
00:00:57,354 --> 00:00:59,042
How many stops is it?

26
00:00:59,308 --> 00:01:00,718
Four from here.

27
00:01:00,718 --> 00:01:03,166
I'll call out the museum stop, too.

28
00:01:03,436 --> 00:01:04,586
Thank you.

29
00:01:04,586 --> 00:01:08,023
We sit near the middle, and I watch the names appear on the screen.

30
00:01:08,308 --> 00:01:10,352
Still our chief trip planner?

31
00:01:10,588 --> 00:01:11,988
Absolutely.

32
00:01:11,988 --> 00:01:14,457
I've just added a new rule to my system.

33
00:01:14,457 --> 00:01:19,082
Check the number, check the direction, and don't act like a genius until you're on the right bus.
